WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:03.086
Terrell arrived at Roxy's house.

2
00:00:03.087 --> 00:00:06.270
"Hi, Terrell," Roxy's mom said.

3
00:00:06.271 --> 00:00:09.155
"Roxy is on a Rocket Girl mission.

4
00:00:09.156 --> 00:00:10.727
She'll be home in—"

5
00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:14.209
Whoosh! Roxy shot into the house like a rocket.

6
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.924
A framed picture swung wildly.

7
00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:19.079
Her mom caught it.

8
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.482
"No flying in the house, Roxy!"

9
00:00:22.483 --> 00:00:25.060
"Oops! Sorry, Mom."

10
00:00:25.061 --> 00:00:28.484
Roxy's dad arrived with pizza.

11
00:00:28.485 --> 00:00:31.282
Everyone sat down to eat.

12
00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:35.776
"What did Rocket Girl do this afternoon?" Roxy's dad asked.

13
00:00:35.777 --> 00:00:37.449
Roxy rolled her eyes.

14
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.797
This was her dad's favorite joke.

15
00:00:39.798 --> 00:00:42.449
He pretended Rocket Girl was someone Roxy knew.

16
00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:45.362
Of course, he knew she was Rocket Girl.

17
00:00:45.363 --> 00:00:49.084
"So?" Her dad handed out slices of pizza.

18
00:00:49.085 --> 00:00:51.602
"Did she fight the giant skunk?"

19
00:00:51.603 --> 00:00:54.598
"What giant skunk?" Roxy asked.

20
00:00:54.599 --> 00:00:59.050
"Somebody saw a giant skunk in Metro City," Terrell said.

21
00:00:59.051 --> 00:01:01.504
He took a bite of pizza.

22
00:01:01.505 --> 00:01:04.126
"I didn't hear about that," Roxy said.

23
00:01:04.127 --> 00:01:06.877
"I was busy talking to the Mighty Man actor.

24
00:01:06.878 --> 00:01:08.850
He can shoot slime now."

25
00:01:08.851 --> 00:01:12.246
"Wow!" Roxy's mom said.

26
00:01:12.247 --> 00:01:13.726
Terrell shrugged.

27
00:01:13.727 --> 00:01:17.823
"You're still the best superhero in Metro City, Roxy."

28
00:01:17.824 --> 00:01:21.727
Roxy smiled. "Thanks, Terrell. I think you're right.

29
00:01:21.728 --> 00:01:24.559
The actor made a big mess at Metro Mart.

30
00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.668
I might have to give him superhero lessons."

31
00:01:27.669 --> 00:01:32.952
Her dad chuckled. "You mean Rocket Girl might have to give him lessons." Roxy

32
00:01:32.953 --> 00:01:34.933
rolled her eyes again. Just

33
00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:38.190
then Terrell bumped his glass. Roxy

34
00:01:38.191 --> 00:01:40.773
grabbed it. Crack! She

35
00:01:40.774 --> 00:01:43.816
accidentally used her super strength. "Sorry!"

36
00:01:43.817 --> 00:01:46.315
Roxy cried. "It's

37
00:01:46.316 --> 00:01:48.563
okay," her dad said. "We're

38
00:01:48.564 --> 00:01:52.810
used to it," Roxy's mom said with a smile. "I

39
00:01:52.811 --> 00:01:58.092
remember when you first got your super powers, Roxy. You

40
00:01:58.093 --> 00:02:01.419
were just two years old." Her

41
00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:06.179
dad nodded. "We called you Doodle Bug back then." Terrell

42
00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:09.358
laughed. "Doodle Bug?" Roxy

43
00:02:09.359 --> 00:02:13.293
turned red. "I don't remember that." Her

44
00:02:13.294 --> 00:02:23.810
mom shrugged. "Of course not. You were really young." ***

45
00:02:23.811 --> 00:02:26.830
That night Roxy lay in bed.

46
00:02:26.831 --> 00:02:31.346
"I wonder how I got my super powers."

47
00:02:31.347 --> 00:02:34.654
"I know how you got them," a voice said.

48
00:02:34.655 --> 00:02:37.844
Roxy sat up. "Who's there?"

49
00:02:37.845 --> 00:02:40.486
She looked around in the dark.

50
00:02:40.487 --> 00:02:43.515
The room was empty.

51
00:02:43.516 --> 00:02:47.727
"I must be imagining things." Roxy lay back down.

52
00:02:47.728 --> 00:02:55.170
Soon she fell asleep and forgot about the voice.

53
00:02:55.171 --> 00:02:59.216
In the morning Roxy jumped out of bed.

54
00:02:59.217 --> 00:03:02.120
"Today will be great!" she thought.

55
00:03:02.121 --> 00:03:05.418
"I'm meeting my friends at Metro City Mall and—"

56
00:03:05.419 --> 00:03:07.255
Her watch beeped.

57
00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:12.730
Roxy groaned and then opened it.

58
00:03:12.731 --> 00:03:15.996
"Rocket Girl!" Mayor Bloom looked nervous.

59
00:03:15.997 --> 00:03:19.825
"Someone is robbing True Savings Bank!"

60
00:03:19.826 --> 00:03:24.132
"Don't worry, Mayor." Roxy sighed.

61
00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:29.907
"I'm on my way."

